{"story":{"id":"event-ancrel-6098","title":{"zh":"隐形场现形","en":"Chameleon Field Exposed"},"category":"precursors","kind":"event","image":"art/60299e8ce2b337a17e5b.webp","start":"ancrel.6099","chapters":9,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"在[tomb_planet.GetName]——我们领土内一颗没有生命存在的[tomb_planet.GetPlanetMoon]地表上，一些古老的建筑物隐藏在某种隐形能量场之下。偶然有一颗小行星在撞击[tomb_planet.GetPlanetMoon]时发生了偏转并被旁经的货船监控到，我们这才发现了它的存在。","en":"A chameleon energy field of some sort concealing an ancient structure was recently exposed on the surface of [tomb_planet.GetName], a lifeless [tomb_planet.GetPlanetMoon] inside our space. Only a chance asteroid impact which was deflected off the field while t"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"ancrel.6099","parent":"n0","via":{"chance":0.0476,"group":"r200","delay":[{"days":"1","random":"350"}],"hooks":["immediate"],"when":[[[{"type":"flag","scope":"global","name":"player_gets_zarqlan","path":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"entry","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:669","sets":["ai_gets_zarqlan","player_gets_zarqlan","zarqlan_spawned"],"triggers":[{"zh":"每年检查","en":"Yearly check"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_zarqlan","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"ancrel.6099.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:753"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.6100","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:186"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.6105","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n5"]},"n5":{"doc":"ancrel.6110","parent":"n4","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n6"]},"n6":{"doc":"ancrel.6115","parent":"n5","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n7"]},"n7":{"doc":"ancrel.6120","parent":"n6","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n8"]},"n8":{"doc":"ancrel.6125","parent":"n7","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n9","n10"]},"n9":{"doc":"ancrel.6130","parent":"n8","via":{"option":"INTRIGUING","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:916"},"children":[]},"n10":{"ref":"n9","doc":"ancrel.6130","parent":"n8","via":{"option":"ancrel.6125.desc.b.evopred","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:931"}}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"ancrel.6099","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"隐形场现形","en":"Chameleon Field Exposed"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[tomb_planet.GetName]——我们领土内一颗没有生命存在的[tomb_planet.GetPlanetMoon]地表上，一些古老的建筑物隐藏在某种隐形能量场之下。偶然有一颗小行星在撞击[tomb_planet.GetPlanetMoon]时发生了偏转并被旁经的货船监控到，我们这才发现了它的存在。","en":"A chameleon energy field of some sort concealing an ancient structure was recently exposed on the surface of [tomb_planet.GetName], a lifeless [tomb_planet.GetPlanetMoon] inside our space. Only a chance asteroid impact which was deflected off the field while the [tomb_planet.GetPlanetMoon] was being monitored by a passing freighter revealed its existence."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/60299e8ce2b337a17e5b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ancrel.6099.a","label":{"zh":"应该对其进行调查。","en":"This should be investigated."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"archaeological_site_types:site_zarqlan","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt:753","story":"event-ancrel-6098"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_2.txt","line":687},"names":{"tomb_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"archaeological_site_types:site_zarqlan","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"古墓","en":"Ancient Tomb"},"texts":[{"zh":"这颗行星的地表上，一座古老的建筑物被隐藏在某种迷彩能量场之下。只是偶然观测到，一颗小行星在撞击时才揭示了它的存在，该小行星化为流星偏转了它的能量场。\n\n在该能量场被关闭后，考古学家们现在可以去探索原本隐藏其下的，令人生畏的巨大建筑群了。","en":"A chameleon energy field was concealing an ancient structure on the surface of this planet. Only a chance observation of an asteroid impact revealed its existence as the meteor deflected off the field.\n\nWith the field deactivated, archaeologists will now have access to the large and forbidding building complex hidden beneath it."}],"sections":[{"zh":"这颗行星的地表上，一座古老的建筑物被隐藏在某种迷彩能量场之下。只是偶然观测到，一颗小行星在撞击时才揭示了它的存在，该小行星化为流星偏转了它的能量场。\n\n在该能量场被关闭后，考古学家们现在可以去探索原本隐藏其下的，令人生畏的巨大建筑群了。","en":"A chameleon energy field was concealing an ancient structure on the surface of this planet. Only a chance observation of an asteroid impact revealed its existence as the meteor deflected off the field.\n\nWith the field deactivated, archaeologists will now have access to the large and forbidding building complex hidden beneath it."}],"image":"art/114a28677a447f6d61c7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.6100","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:186","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"event-ancrel-6098"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29549","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29549","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incident